lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源DiNA架构</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多代码仓库协同</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯企业微信正式开源命令行工具wecom-cli，支持AI Agent调用</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义实验室发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及创作工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c3b901abb4903f434ab5254da4c224f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义实验室正式发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及配套创作工具，旨在解决AI视频生成中的内容专业度不足与修改困难问题。该模型支持文本、图像、视频及音频的全模态输入，赋予用户对画面结构、剧情走向及局部细节的精确控制能力。在编辑功能上，Wan2.7-Video支持通过指令实现元素删除、物体替换、背景环境转换及风格一键切换。针对剧情创作，用户无需重新拍摄即可调整角色台词、动作及镜头角度。此外，该工具还具备创意快速复刻与剧情延续功能，通过精准的时序控制实现视频无缝衔接。Wan2.7-Video的推出显著提升了视频创作的灵活性与便捷性，允许用户像编辑文档一样对视频内容进行深度修改，为专业创作者提供了更高效的生产力工具。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式开源Gemma 4模型系列：采用Apache 2.0协议并支持端侧部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1d22e11eec6c71e104a1c8a05dcf79c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式发布新一代开源模型系列Gemma 4，并全面转向Apache 2.0协议，支持商用与二次开发。该系列包含四款模型：31B Dense旗舰版支持256K上下文，单张H100即可运行；26B A4B MoE采用混合专家架构，激活参数仅3.8B；E4B与E2B专为端侧优化，E2B内存占用可压至1.5GB以下。性能方面，Gemma 4在AIME 2026数学测试中得分达89.2%，Codeforces ELO评分升至2150。核心特性包括内置可开关的“思考模式”、原生Agent支持及深度多模态能力，全版本支持图像与视频输入。此次发布通过极致的端侧工程化与更开放的协议，显著提升了谷歌在开源AI领域的竞争力，为开发者提供了更具性价比的部署方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源DiNA架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/44e1a09efaf95a2101de11705dc6767f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团技术团队正式发布并开源原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next，该模型摒弃了“语言基座+插件”的拼凑架构，通过DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构实现了视觉、语音与文本的底层统一。LongCat-Next将图像、语音与文本转化为同源的离散Token，使模型能以统一的参数、注意力机制和损失函数处理多模态数据。核心技术包括支持任意分辨率输入的dNaViT视觉分词器，通过8层残差向量量化实现28倍像素空间压缩。性能方面，该模型在OmniDocBench密集文本场景中超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，在MathVista测试中达到83.1分，同时保持C-Eval 86.80的语言能力。此次开源旨在为开发者提供构建感知物理世界AI的工具，支持低延迟并行文本语音生成及语音克隆，推动AI从语言中心向物理世界感知演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多代码仓库协同</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/406b78eec862fc61ca34a2776c0327d4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor 团队正式发布 Cursor 3 版本，标志着软件开发模式从“人机协作”向“智能体自主工作”转型。该版本核心创新在于“智能体统一工作区”设计，允许用户在侧边栏集中管理本地及云端智能体，并支持从移动端、Web、桌面及 Slack 等多终端启动。新版本实现了本地与云端智能体会话的无缝切换，确保长时间任务在离线状态下仍能持续运行。在协作层面，Cursor 3 引入了简洁的差异视图 UI，显著提升了代码审查与变更编辑的效率，同时保持对语言服务器协议（LSP）、内置浏览器及各类插件的完整支持。云端智能体现可自动生成工作成果演示与截图，辅助开发者直观确认项目进展。用户可通过升级 Cursor 并输入 Cmd+Shift+P 调出 Agents Window 体验新功能。Cursor 团队表示，未来将持续优化 I</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯企业微信正式开源命令行工具wecom-cli，支持AI Agent调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9ab2b70692e5db495aebc1dcee940acb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯企业微信于3月30日正式在GitHub开源命令行工具wecom-cli，旨在提升企业办公场景的AI应用开发效率。该工具开放了消息、日程、文档、智能表、会议、待办、通讯录七大核心产品能力，并支持Claude Code、Codex、WorkBuddy、QClaw等主流AI Agent调用。开发者通过配置企业微信机器人Bot ID及Secret，即可利用CLI实现对上述功能的自动化操作，如发送群聊消息、新建文档、查询日程闲忙状态及管理待办任务等。该工具要求Node.js环境，通过安装CLI及CLI SKILL即可快速部署。此次开源降低了企业微信能力与AI Agent集成的技术门槛，使AI能够以更自然的方式理解并调用企业办公数据，助力开发者快速构建贴近业务需求的智能化办公解决方案。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
